        "Content": "<ul><li> Detached four-bedroom bungalow</li><li> Elevated site extending to approximately 0.51 acre</li><li> Panoramic views over the Lakes of Killarney and surrounding mountains</li><li> Southerly aspect</li><li> Approx. 106 sq. m. / 1,141 sq. ft. accommodation</li><li> Spacious living room with open fireplace</li><li> Kitchen with solid-fuel stove</li><li> Oil heating</li><li> Septic tank</li><li> Four bedrooms, including principal bedroom with en-suite</li><li> Detached steel-framed shed</li><li> Peaceful countryside setting</li><li> Approximately 9km from Killarney town</li><li> Excellent access to Killarney National Park and surrounding amenities</li><li> Superb opportunity to modernise and create a wonderful family home in an exceptional location</ul>"
